==English==

===Etymology===
Unclear, possibly from "high fluting".

===Alternative spellings===
*[[hifalutin]]
*[[highfaluting]]
*[[high falutin]]

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

#{{informal}} Self-[[important]], [[pompous]]; [[arrogant]] or [[egotistical]]; tending to [[show off]] or hold oneself in unduly high [[regard]].
#:''It's only a matter of time before some '''highfalutin''' developer builds a huge hotel and ruins the scenery.''

